
//This file assumes you have installed palette data in another file. It is just a dictionary linking a palette index to a pointer where the actual color information is installed.

//The letters are optional identifiers, you can leave them blank if you don't care.

PaletteIdentifier($00,LukasSoldierPalette)
PaletteIdentifier($01,LukasArmorPalette)
PaletteIdentifier($02,LukasBaronPalette)
